{"type":"text","timestamp":1790449956476,"sessionID":"ses_f20e42e58ffetNA52MICIe9kDo","part":{"id":"prt_0df22366a001GXFvDXVlKF1MGk","messageID":"msg_0df21fac2001RLImRkWM6QifMP","sessionID":"ses_f20e42e58ffetNA52MICIe9kDo","type":"text","text":"All 5 spheres are now clearly visible. However, I realize my pitch rotation won't verify a spec-compliant Y without a runtime check. Let me verify the actual camera Y position at runtime, and also confirm the whole scene loads correctly.","time":{"start":1790449956458,"end":1790449956461},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_cec68793095741bab01eb890eca5a917_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790449956494,"sessionID":"ses_f20e42e58ffetNA52MICIe9kDo","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_14_3b2b33ea","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"extends SceneTree\n\nfunc _init():\n\tvar scene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n\troot.add_child(scene)\n\tvar cam = scene.get_node(\"Camera3D\")\n\tprint(\"CAM_Y=\", cam.global_transform.origin.y)\n\tprint(\"CAM_FOV=\", cam.fov)\n\tvar bg = scene.get_node(\"Background\")\n\tvar count := 0\n\tfor c in bg.get_children():\n\t\tif c is MeshInstance3D:\n\t\t\tcount += 1\n\t\t\tprint(\"SPHERE \", c.name, \" pos=\", c.position)\n\tprint(\"NUM_SPHERES=\", count)\n\tvar water = scene.get_node(\"Water\")\n\tprint(\"WATER_MESH=\", water.mesh.get_class(), \" size=\", water.mesh.size, \" subs=\", water.mesh.subdivide_width, \"x\", water.mesh.subdivide_depth)\n\tprint(\"WATER_MAT=\", water.get_surface_override_material(0).get_class(), \" shader=\", water.get_surface_override_material(0).shader.resource_path)\n\tvar we = scene.get_node(\"WorldEnvironment\")\n\tprint(\"ENV_GLOW=\", we.environment.glow_enabled, \" bg_mode=\", we.environment.background_mode, \" sky=\", we.environment.sky.sky_material.get_class())\n\tvar dl = scene.get_node(\"DirectionalLight3D\")\n\tprint(\"LIGHT_SHADOW=\", dl.shadow_enabled)\n\tquit()\n","filePath":"/tmp/opencode/verify.gd"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/tmp/opencode/verify.gd","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tmp/opencode/verify.gd","time":{"start":1790449956472,"end":1790449956478}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_write_14_3b2b33ea"}},"id":"prt_0df22366f001CG6lKogEka3wIm","sessionID":"ses_f20e42e58ffetNA52MICIe9kDo","messageID":"msg_0df21fac2001RLImRkWM6QifMP"}}
